# adMYTT marketing website — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and set in your host (Vercel) for production.

# Where validated demo-request submissions are POSTed as JSON.
# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION — without it, the /book-a-demo form returns an error
# instead of silently dropping leads. Point this at a durable sink, e.g. a
# Zapier/Make "Catch Hook" URL that emails your sales inbox and/or logs to a sheet.
# The POST body is JSON: { name, company, email, phone, team, branches, system, message, utm, receivedAt }
DEMO_WEBHOOK_URL=
